11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿魏鸿胪七帙 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"诗酒弦歌寄此生，风流重见顾家瑛。\n不须屈指量贫富，七十年中擅太平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42976,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿魏鸿胪七帙 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"庭前木兰何太奇，千朵万朵白迷离。\n争似中堂双玉树，对翻华萼吐孙枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42977,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿魏鸿胪七帙 其三","author":"王世贞","text":"牙绯艾绿拥朋尊，可爱君家好弟昆。\n犹有雍容诗礼在，令人长忆魏阳元。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42978,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿魏鸿胪七帙 其四","author":"王世贞","text":"宾筵弁侧半傀俄，犹戴乌纱检白波。\n不为一官能恋恋，少年辛苦读书多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42979,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"周三俊郎时诵道书辞其舅学士公游南太学得绝句二首 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"十里珠帘出晓妆，长干春色待周郎。\n从他误曲毋劳顾，留得斋心奉紫皇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42980,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"周三俊郎时诵道书辞其舅学士公游南太学得绝句二首 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"袖里南华与舅论，翻从玉润爱冰神。\n晚菘早韭山中味，慎莫夸他肉食人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42981,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏为樱桃题二绝句 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"葡萄赐紫那同贵，金橘堆黄剩是酸。\n何似琢圆千靺鞨，深红透出水晶盘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42982,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏为樱桃题二绝句 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"含桃一荐柏梁新，偷入新诗郭舍人。\n笑杀上林村令句，李梅争似齧妃唇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42983,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送张兰溪公除补选 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"迢迢单舫上天京，单父当年政已成。\n五月南薰无限意，弹琴莫道不成声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42984,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送张兰溪公除补选 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"曾传八咏在东阳，可借双凫下未央。\n溪边小儿骑竹马，洞口仙人呼石羊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42985,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"襄国王飞教千里岁一慰存野人无以仰酬惟祝麟趾之庆而已敬成四绝情见乎辞 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"老龙堤畔彩云开，千乘旌旗射猎来。\n蔽日鹏雏浑不管，掌中贪捧一珠回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42986,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"襄国王飞教千里岁一慰存野人无以仰酬惟祝麟趾之庆而已敬成四绝情见乎辞 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"渚宫春雪一登坛，宋玉文成最耐看。\n十二巫峰尽盘石，莫容云雨梦中残。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42987,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"襄国王飞教千里岁一慰存野人无以仰酬惟祝麟趾之庆而已敬成四绝情见乎辞 其三","author":"王世贞","text":"六月金盘安石榴，榴房忽绽玉浆流。\n欲知太母尝新意，亲遣高王问魏收。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42988,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"襄国王飞教千里岁一慰存野人无以仰酬惟祝麟趾之庆而已敬成四绝情见乎辞 其四","author":"王世贞","text":"老病蒙庄五亩阴，年年孤负楚王金。\n虽然曳尾泥涂乐，未少衔珠一片心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42989,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陈道复写牡丹征仲题句以徐熙拟之戏步于后","author":"王世贞","text":"谁将野逸拟徐熙，一种妖红晕玉肌。\n应是陈闳被宣召，沈香亭畔写杨妃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42990,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答沈嘉则 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"风流翻入步虚词，南国人称沈亚之。\n不信缑山辛苦意，只言笙鹤便相随。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42991,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答沈嘉则 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"才从苦海脱沈沦，两鬓萧疏已似银。\n君是谪仙宁不解，玉京那有半残人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42992,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同州王先生赐绂依昙阳庵修西方业以俟师真盻蚃少子某迎之不可于其归也代先生送之 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"阿翁非为远公留，为觅金篦净土游。\n十万八千犹未是，可应西向忆同州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42993,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同州王先生赐绂依昙阳庵修西方业以俟师真盻蚃少子某迎之不可于其归也代先生送之 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"莫因离别泪阑干，老子冰心彻底寒。\n会得西归真意后，不妨儿女话团圞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42994,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同州二先辈以书迎其父令公归不得作二绝慰之 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"雪山行道不辞辛，车匿空归罗㬋嗔。\n以此深心奉尘刹，古来方是报恩人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42995,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同州二先辈以书迎其父令公归不得作二绝慰之 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"朝闻丹诀暮西还，不踏江南处处山。\n但使郎君如尹喜，可容真气误函关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42996,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题枫谷卷为杭州喻邦相 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"春至能青秋更丹，山深不共荻花寒。\n武林官道知多少，总与行人醉面看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42997,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题枫谷卷为杭州喻邦相 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"庭葵向阳知故赤，谷枫背日亦成丹。\n总令心事各有寄，谁解霜风领岁寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42998,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠钱效拙六帙寿言二绝句 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"钱翁长余星一周，十年先着鹿皮裘。\n如逢海上添筹客，为我聊呼第二筹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42999,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠钱效拙六帙寿言二绝句 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"鲁连乍觅东海住，安期复从海东来。\n饮君寿酒君试问，为是仙才说客才。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43000,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠黄鹄 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"道子粗豪故有神，精微仍数李公麟。\n何当扫尽铅华态，貌得乾坤万古真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43001,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠黄鹄 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"誓墓归来老病身，无心去逐世间尘。\n与君轰饮君犹恨，不写人间第一人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43002,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄赠吴大倕倩","author":"王世贞","text":"十载吴郎已大名，青山依旧楚诸生。\n似闻老蚌蹉跎意，欲遣双珠入帝城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43003,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄赠吴二皋倩","author":"王世贞","text":"酒态傀俄兄不如，弄船钓得武昌鱼。\n青藜忽破高斋色，醒后吾伊读父书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43004,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和张肖甫司马题王阳德使君阳湖别墅十咏 其一 知乐轩","author":"王世贞","text":"鲸口初分玉涧余，金鳞点点跃青渠。\n欲知鱼乐无如子，曾向澄江梦作鱼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43005,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和张肖甫司马题王阳德使君阳湖别墅十咏 其二 清凉界","author":"王世贞","text":"从他赤日也清凉，室利南来是道场。\n不似石家金谷地，热心偏向绿珠忙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43006,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和张肖甫司马题王阳德使君阳湖别墅十咏 其三 纡青阁","author":"王世贞","text":"小阁疏帘面面开，不知何处送青来。\n佛螺欲傍斜阳敛，那有珠丝系得回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43007,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和张肖甫司马题王阳德使君阳湖别墅十咏 其四 红雨蹊","author":"王世贞","text":"天花争坠不黏身，下作东林红锦裀。\n却恨酒醒眠起后，悄然无计一留春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43008,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和张肖甫司马题王阳德使君阳湖别墅十咏 其五 浮碧台","author":"王世贞","text":"千寻碧皱倚空蒙，湖眼山眉态不穷。\n错讶楼台缘蜃气，中天涌出化人宫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43009,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和张肖甫司马题王阳德使君阳湖别墅十咏 其六 金粟岭","author":"王世贞","text":"纷纷金粟万如来，移自西方七宝台。\n笑杀中秋灵隐夜，总令收得不堪栽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43010,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和张肖甫司马题王阳德使君阳湖别墅十咏 其七 穿云峡","author":"王世贞","text":"有时峡坼流云逗，有时云薄峰尖透。\n主人蹑屐伛偻归，剪得氤缊满双袖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43011,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和张肖甫司马题王阳德使君阳湖别墅十咏 其八 超然台","author":"王世贞","text":"旸湖千顷白云流，百尺隗俄在上头。\n欲语超然无可道，不牵尘世一丝愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43012,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和张肖甫司马题王阳德使君阳湖别墅十咏 其九 筠阿馆","author":"王世贞","text":"万条青玉逼云寒，余箨犹堪剪作冠。\n张廌莫跨居处好，王家亦自有琅玕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43013,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和张肖甫司马题王阳德使君阳湖别墅十咏 其十 暑香亭","author":"王世贞","text":"才歌白苎水生凉，脉脉柔风送暗香。\n记取郑公三伏日，碧筒徐吸紫霞浆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43014,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶题 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"抛却功名事上真，名根犹自惹凡尘。\n怪来人鸟宫中客，多是羲皇向上人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43015,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶题 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"平生不拟作裴休，见有遗书好拨愁。\n拨得一行黄蘖字，何须更访赤松游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43016,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蔡文学曼倩求书其赠大父九十四翁及父孝廉诗因题一绝于后","author":"王世贞","text":"九十四翁归道乡，孝廉花萼日相望。\n看君三世催身老，不是夸君大父行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43017,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"昨秋有传殿卿左史游道山者得一绝见慰不胜快心走笔奉贺","author":"王世贞","text":"春来飞梦玉京山，乞得交梨一颗还。\n遍叩金台无长史，祗应犹自在人间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43018,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"有莲洲比丘者托康生寄一偈云法身有口能噇饭大地无尘翳眼睛此事遥知已相悉愿垂一语印愚情率尔奉答","author":"王世贞","text":"噇饭莫贪香积饭，无尘翻惹六根尘。\n通身是口通身眼，口眼应须赚世人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43019,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"又代僧答","author":"王世贞","text":"噇饭何妨香积饭，无尘一任世间尘。\n通身是口通身眼，口眼何曾赚世人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43020,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题李使君扇头小画","author":"王世贞","text":"几重云树几重山，小小茅檐三两间。\n但许使君赍酒至，不妨南陌荷锄还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43021,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"袁绳之太常起家赴南少司空走笔为赠 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"汉家清议重南宫，卧雪能怜袁邵公。\n总为太常高第久，玺书连旦拜司空。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43022,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"袁绳之太常起家赴南少司空走笔为赠 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"单车轧轧度丹阳，十载清名扬太常。\n任是令公家宴好，也应中夜减红妆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43023,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"袁绳之太常起家赴南少司空走笔为赠 其三","author":"王世贞","text":"颠倒衣裳白发侵，箧中腰带半无金。\n当时谏草垂磨灭，犹是区区请剑心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43024,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"袁绳之太常起家赴南少司空走笔为赠 其四","author":"王世贞","text":"依然蓝笋叩精兰，剥啄声停稚子欢。\n懒病科头当六月，不因知己便弹冠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43025,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴生得神符治余少子士骏疟应手即愈走笔赠之","author":"王世贞","text":"眼见儿曹病骨苏，将言无鬼未全无。\n少陵总有花卿句，不及吴郎一字符。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43026,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶成 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"楚英晚节希转轮，汉狱株连千万人。\n清净慈悲两安在，西来谁为治贪嗔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43027,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶成 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"读书万卷葛勾漏，饮酒千钟郭景纯。\n狂夫借此聊自暖，第恐天宫无二人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43028,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶成 其三","author":"王世贞","text":"畴尊武媚作越古，畴字阿?为总持。\n不怕舌尖难过鼻，只谋衣钵且宽眉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43029,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶成 其四","author":"王世贞","text":"古来持律让宣公，何事贪它天食供。\n身后拟归慈氏院，眼前不见西来宗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43030,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶成 其五","author":"王世贞","text":"于阗比汉一小县，纵令护法能几何。\n懊恨谈禅裴相国，不将黄蘖换青娥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43031,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶成 其六","author":"王世贞","text":"海山方丈不肯住，要住第三兜率天。\n只恐放教居外院，小蛮樊素共年年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43032,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶成 其七","author":"王世贞","text":"白云先生高侍中，自夸呼吸与天通。\n斗大扬州贡赋绝，祗缘真诰有曹公。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43033,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶成 其八","author":"王世贞","text":"西昆艳体杨学士，醉里禅那夸更深。\n金面棋盘都拍碎，却因丁寇便惊心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43034,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶成 其九","author":"王世贞","text":"莲经女子转山谷，五戒禅师作东坡。\n一升一降事未已，更四百年将奈何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43035,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶成 其十","author":"王世贞","text":"少年谤法晚护法，□抨鲁公少温公。\n僧雏两耳掩欲尽，未必西天耳尽聋。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43036,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶成 其十一","author":"王世贞","text":"纵横说法张无垢，犹自低头妙喜公。\n读尽传灯杲师业，觉他心地未全空。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43037,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]